---
description: Review the selected Personal workspace facility to interpret its own scoped evidence.
args:
  request: FacilityRequest
returns: FacilityReview
---
1. For browser call reviewBrowserImport. For collection call reviewCollection. For tour call reviewTour. For mission call reviewMission. For explorer call reviewExplorer.
2. Return the chosen review unchanged. Use the supplied identities and evidence. The program describes an observed outcome or the next review condition. It does not apply it.
